{"seq":1,"slug":"linux-administration","title":"Linux 运维","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/linux-administration","wordCount":696,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"linux-运维\">Linux 运维</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>Linux 是全球超过 96% 服务器的操作系统，从云服务器到容器运行时都构建在 Linux 之上。高职软件技术专业的 Linux 课程以 CentOS/Ubuntu 为实践环境，培养学生独立完成服务器部署、故障排查和安全加固的运维能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"文件系统与目录结构\">文件系统与目录结构</h3><p>Linux 采用树形文件系统，一切皆文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"/&#10;├── bin/         # 基本命令（ls, cp, mv）&#10;├── etc/         # 系统配置文件&#10;├── home/        # 用户主目录&#10;├── var/         # 可变数据（日志、缓存）&#10;│   └── log/     # 系统和应用日志&#10;├── opt/         # 第三方软件安装&#10;├── tmp/         # 临时文件&#10;└── usr/         # 用户程序&#10;    ├── local/   # 手动安装的软件&#10;    └── bin/     # 用户命令\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── bin/         # 基本命令（ls, cp, mv）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── etc/         # 系统配置文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── home/        # 用户主目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── var/         # 可变数据（日志、缓存）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── log/     # 系统和应用日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── opt/         # 第三方软件安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tmp/         # 临时文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── usr/         # 用户程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── local/   # 手动安装的软件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── bin/     # 用户命令</span></span></code></pre></div><p>文件操作核心命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查找文件&#10;find /var/log -name &quot;*.log&quot; -mtime -7      # 最近7天修改的日志&#10;&#10;# 文本处理三剑客&#10;grep -r &quot;ERROR&quot; /var/log/app/ --include=&quot;*.log&quot;   # 递归搜索错误&#10;awk &#39;{print $1, $4}&#39; access.log | sort | uniq -c  # 统计 IP 访问量&#10;sed -i &#39;s/8080/9090/g&#39; application.yml             # 批量替换端口号&#10;&#10;# 磁盘管理&#10;df -h                    # 查看磁盘使用率&#10;du -sh /var/log/*       # 各目录占用空间\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查找文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.log\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -mtime</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -7</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 最近7天修改的日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 文本处理三剑客</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ERROR\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log/app/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --include=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*.log\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 递归搜索错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1, $4}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 统计 IP 访问量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/8080/9090/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> application.yml</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # 批量替换端口号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 磁盘管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">df</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 查看磁盘使用率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">du</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 各目录占用空间</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"用户与权限管理\">用户与权限管理</h3><p>Linux 权限模型由用户（User）、组（Group）和其他（Other）三部分构成，每部分拥有读（r=4）、写（w=2）、执行（x=1）三种权限：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 权限示例&#10;-rwxr-xr--  1 deploy appgroup  4096 May 01 10:00 app.jar&#10;# 所有者: rwx(7) | 同组: r-x(5) | 其他: r--(4) → 754&#10;&#10;# 用户管理&#10;useradd -m -s /bin/bash deploy         # 创建部署专用用户&#10;usermod -aG docker deploy              # 加入 docker 组&#10;chmod 750 /opt/app                     # 设置目录权限&#10;chown -R deploy:appgroup /opt/app      # 更改所有权\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 权限示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-rwxr-xr--</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> appgroup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  4096</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> May</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 01</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 10:00</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 所有者: rwx(7) | 同组: r-x(5) | 其他: r--(4) → 754</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 用户管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useradd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /bin/bash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # 创建部署专用用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">usermod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -aG</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 加入 docker 组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 750</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/app</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                     # 设置目录权限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chown</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy:appgroup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/app</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 更改所有权</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最小权限原则：应用进程以非 root 用户运行，数据库端口不对外暴露，SSH 禁止 root 直接登录。</p>\n<h3 id=\"shell-脚本编程\">Shell 脚本编程</h3><p>Shell 脚本将重复性运维操作自动化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# 应用部署脚本&#10;&#10;APP_NAME=&quot;myapp&quot;&#10;JAR_FILE=&quot;/opt/app/${APP_NAME}.jar&quot;&#10;LOG_FILE=&quot;/var/log/${APP_NAME}/app.log&quot;&#10;PID_FILE=&quot;/var/run/${APP_NAME}.pid&quot;&#10;&#10;start() {&#10;    if [ -f &quot;$PID_FILE&quot; ] &amp;&amp; kill -0 $(cat &quot;$PID_FILE&quot;) 2&gt;/dev/null; then&#10;        echo &quot;${APP_NAME} 已在运行中 (PID: $(cat $PID_FILE))&quot;&#10;        return 1&#10;    fi&#10;&#10;    echo &quot;启动 ${APP_NAME}...&quot;&#10;    nohup java -Xmx512m -jar &quot;$JAR_FILE&quot; \\&#10;        --spring.profiles.active=prod \\&#10;        &gt; &quot;$LOG_FILE&quot; 2&gt;&amp;1 &amp;&#10;&#10;    echo $! &gt; &quot;$PID_FILE&quot;&#10;    echo &quot;${APP_NAME} 启动成功 (PID: $!)&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;stop() {&#10;    if [ ! -f &quot;$PID_FILE&quot; ]; then&#10;        echo &quot;${APP_NAME} 未在运行&quot;&#10;        return 1&#10;    fi&#10;&#10;    local pid=$(cat &quot;$PID_FILE&quot;)&#10;    echo &quot;停止 ${APP_NAME} (PID: ${pid})...&quot;&#10;    kill &quot;$pid&quot;&#10;&#10;    # 等待进程退出，最多30秒&#10;    for i in $(seq 1 30); do&#10;        if ! kill -0 &quot;$pid&quot; 2&gt;/dev/null; then&#10;            rm -f &quot;$PID_FILE&quot;&#10;            echo &quot;${APP_NAME} 已停止&quot;&#10;            return 0&#10;        fi&#10;        sleep 1&#10;    done&#10;&#10;    kill -9 &quot;$pid&quot;&#10;    rm -f &quot;$PID_FILE&quot;&#10;    echo &quot;${APP_NAME} 强制终止&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;case &quot;$1&quot; in&#10;    start)  start ;;&#10;    stop)   stop ;;&#10;    restart) stop &amp;&amp; sleep 2 &amp;&amp; start ;;&#10;    *) echo &quot;用法: $0 {start|stop|restart}&quot; ;;&#10;esac\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 应用部署脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">APP_NAME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"myapp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">JAR_FILE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/opt/app/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">APP_NAME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.jar\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LOG_FILE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/var/log/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">APP_NAME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/app.log\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PID_FILE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/var/run/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">APP_NAME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.pid\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$PID_FILE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ] &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kill</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$PID_FILE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">2></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">APP_NAME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 已在运行中 (PID: $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $PID_FILE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">))\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><s