\"><span>[Service]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Type=simple</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>User=deploy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ExecStart=/usr/bin/java -Xmx512m -jar /opt/app/myapp.jar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Restart=on-failure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RestartSec=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Install]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WantedBy=multi-user.target</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"systemctl daemon-reload&#10;systemctl enable myapp       # 开机自启&#10;systemctl start myapp        # 启动&#10;systemctl status myapp       # 查看状态&#10;journalctl -u myapp -f       # 实时查看日志\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> daemon-reload</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> enable</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 开机自启</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 启动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 查看状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">journalctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 实时查看日志</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"日志分析\">日志分析</h3><p>日志是故障排查的第一手资料：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 实时追踪错误日志&#10;tail -f /var/log/app/error.log | grep --line-buffered &quot;Exception&quot;&#10;&#10;# 统计最近1小时 5xx 错误数&#10;awk -v start=&quot;$(date -d &#39;1 hour ago&#39; &#39;+%d/%b/%Y:%H:%M&#39;)&quot; \\&#10;    &#39;$4 &gt; &quot;[&quot;start &amp;&amp; $9 ~ /^5/&#39; access.log | wc -l&#10;&#10;# 按分钟统计请求量（发现流量突增）&#10;awk &#39;{print substr($4, 2, 17)}&#39; access.log | sort | uniq -c | tail -20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实时追踪错误日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log/app/error.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --line-buffered</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Exception\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统计最近1小时 5xx 错误数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start=\"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1 hour ago' '+%d/%b/%Y:%H:%M')\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '$4 > \"[\"start &#x26;&#x26; $9 ~ /^5/'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按分钟统计请求量（发现流量突增）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print substr($4, 2, 17)}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -20</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ELK Stack（Elasticsearch + Logstash + Kibana）是企业级日志平台的标准方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"安全加固\">安全加固</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# SSH 安全配置 (/etc/ssh/sshd_config)&#10;PermitRootLogin no           # 禁止 root SSH&#10;PasswordAuthentication no    # 仅密钥认证&#10;Port 2222                    # 修改默认端口&#10;&#10;# 防火墙 (firewalld)&#10;firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=80/tcp&#10;firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=443/tcp&#10;firewall-cmd --reload&#10;&#10;# fail2ban 防暴力破解&#10;apt install fail2ban&#10;systemctl enable fail2ban\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># SSH 安全配置 (/etc/ssh/sshd_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PermitRootLogin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> no</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 禁止 root SSH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PasswordAuthentication</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> no</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 仅密钥认证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Port</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2222</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 修改默认端口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 防火墙 (firewalld)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">firewall-cmd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --permanent</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --add-port=80/tcp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">firewall-cmd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --permanent</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --add-port=443/tcp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">firewall-cmd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --reload</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># fail2ban 防暴力破解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fail2ban</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> enable</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fail2ban</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>不可变基础设施</strong>：2026 年服务器不再&quot;维护&quot;而是&quot;替换&quot;——出问题直接销毁重建新实例，配合 Terraform + Ansible 实现</li>\n<li><strong>eBPF 可观测性</strong>：Linux 内核级别的观测能力，无需修改应用代码即可获取网络流量、系统调用等详细信息</li>\n<li><strong>AI 辅助运维</strong>：AIOps 工具可自动识别日志中的异常模式、预测故障、生成排查建议</li>\n<li><strong>安全左移</strong>：DevSecOps 将安全检查嵌入 CI 流水线，容器镜像扫描、依赖漏洞检测在部署前自动完成</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在云服务器（或虚拟机）上完成以下操作：创建 deploy 用户、配置 SSH 密钥登录并禁止密码登录、安装 JDK 17、部署一个 Spring Boot 应用并配置为 systemd 服务。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>编写一个 Shell 脚本实现日志轮转：当 <code>/var/log/app/app.log</code> 超过 100MB 时，将其压缩归档为 <code>app.log.{date}.gz</code>，保留最近 7 天的归档，自动清理更早的文件。配置 crontab 每小时执行一次。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>模拟线上故障排查：在应用日志中注入大量 ERROR 信息，使用 grep + awk 组合定位错误集中的时间段和错误类型，编写排查报告说明根因和修复方案。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Linux 运维能力是后端开发者和运维工程师的必备技能。文件系统操作和权限管理保障了系统安全；Shell 脚本将重复操作自动化；systemd 和日志分析支撑了应用的稳定运行。掌握这些基础后，进阶的容器化和 Kubernetes 编排才有坚实的操作系统层支撑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Linux 运维","id":"linux-运维"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"文件系统与目录结构","id":"文件系统与目录结构"},{"level":3,"text":"用户与权限管理","id":"用户与权限管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Shell 脚本编程","id":"shell-脚本编程"},{"level":3,"text":"服务部署与进程管理","id":"服务部署与进程管理"},{"level":3,"text":"日志分析","id":"日志分析"},{"level":3,"text":"安全加固","id":"安全加固"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"敏捷项目管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/software-engineering/agile-project-management"},"next":{"title":"容器与编排","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/container-orchestration"}}